    "content": "Once per week, completing the level 10 story step gives you a black lion key. To do this farm, you need a character slot and 8 Tomes of knowledge per run (or other level boosting items)\n\nCreation settings:\nHuman Guardian -> commoner background, rest doesn't matter.\n\nTime: give yourself a half hour, but you can get down to about half that time. As a small challenge to myself I'm going to be recording and posting my updated best time in this post (as a youtube link) for people who want some guidance on how to get faster.\n\nCurrent best time: 15:24\nhttps://youtu.be/oNW-IJkThdo",
